      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont think an official records dept is gonna tell me the truth if theyre in on it. but i do have a list of dates and times from my neighbors. i jst noticed that several crews were on our street on tuesday at 3am and again friday at 4am... that doesnt seem like normal working hours for pipe repair. can u help me look at these times and see if they align with anything else? like maybe when the local wifi is busiest or something? i need to find the logic behind it.",
